{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_03_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e17c8c924b4c6899c1ab8bbdde4cd84fcf8a4d3773006a672496946ef68fea68",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c280ba1476b1ad449f885e2b6f78ed4f03c75e3eea7f6c9fe4dccedbd081a4e",
      "text": "下一个项目是……平衡木吗。这种程度小菜一碟啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f189ac667c3497adde104ea686d233b32ddb2eb91f95eee8fc2bf5aee5c3b787",
      "text": "别大意啊，悠介！\n好好看着前面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc14b32bdd1697aa216a35486a4523412a3da97758abfc68e6ea2d0dfe2ef028",
      "text": "我的平衡感有多好你又不是不知道。\n看招……你看，这不是完全没问题嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_d:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:220cc6e6d4a2c52a30f0791c803783f5a91cb82268c6c877a57fb30781b9300e",
      "text": "好啦好啦。那接下来轮到我了。\n嘿……。好，顺利通过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_d:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00a6e12772a79fb4b8d86ca69311eb06ef1fdc3bfae16c398d8f9a136372266c",
      "text": "这次的比赛是……。两个人互相传球带球\n前进就行了吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_d:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58108801dd2e8cc0c443520b2e5f2c9ea2c76a839e9fe875bd14b8cb77a1a086",
      "text": "凭我们的话轻轻松松就能通关啦。\n上吧，享介！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_d:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d5e5916b0799fa09fd3916645ca52e1e0c011705afbefb3a2c07cb9c26ede6e",
      "text": "好传，悠介！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_d:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9655ee47f049ab641b4e393db8e9aa7a56db8b5a096e8b48118bdb415b21cf99",
      "text": "（……嗯。脚的状况看起来没问题。\n就这样配合悠介的节奏的话……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_d:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18fc4d2aab9dbfe2933ec082a00c5e34bd899ba5a80aeb63c81fe605a5621ca6",
      "text": "看啊，享介！跟第2名已经拉开这么大差距了。\n我们绝对是一马当先啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_d:cmd-000169:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce1b829a5e8273abc83b6a1c8ca47cd2ea54008a7356bac23a0cd3e001f02cb8",
      "text": "果然我们是最强的！\n保持这个势头，继续冲吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
